  preview: Got your contact. Need {item} for a private thing...
  introduction: I got your number from a friend. I'm organizing a small gathering
    and I'm looking for some {item}. If the quality is good, I'll take {amount}.
    I'm thinking about {price} for this. Let me know.
  acceptTask: 'Good. Send the location and a photo of the spot. No face, no names.

'
  rejectTask: "...Alright. Noted. I'll remember this.\r"
  bargainPositive: Deal. {price} it is. But for that price, make sure it's clean.
    Send details.
  bargainNegative: Too high. Not worth the risk for me. Maybe next time if price
    drops.
  dealOverPositive: Found it. Clean. We're good.
  dealOverNegative: ...Nothing showed up. I'm deleting the conversation. This never
    happened.
